    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96744" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στῆριγξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιγγος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>support, prop, stay</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τοῦ
				σώματος</span>, of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνήμη</span> or large bone of the leg, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ς. [τῶν πύργων</span>] <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				18.70
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρακερκίς</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.191
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fork with which the shaft</i> or <i>pole of a two-wheeled
				chariot was propped</i>, until the beasts were yoked to it,
				<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				330
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.280f
			</span></i>: acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στήριγγᾰν</span> Maiuri
				<i>Nuova Silloge</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				48
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Rhodes</span>).</div>
